{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46860","headline":"寄吴拾遗 · 齐己","name":"寄吴拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新竹将谁搉重轻，皎然评里见权衡。\n非无苦到难搜处，合有清垂不朽名。\n疎雨晚冲莲叶响，乱蝉凉抱桧梢鸣。\n野桥闲背残阳立，翻忆苏卿送子卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}